{"availability":"available","full":"Jamil1016/fieldnote","name":"fieldnote","description":"Workforce daily-report compliance demo: durable, resumable bulk approvals (SKIP LOCKED claims, idempotent write-back), hours-variance heatmap, role tiers, exactly-once reminders. Clean-room build on invented data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-19T13:04:03Z","updated":"2026-09-19T13:40:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fieldnote-five.vercel.app","topics":["data-visualization","idempotency","internal-tools","job-queue","nextjs","postgres","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://fieldnote-five.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.528Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.528Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.528Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.528Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Daily-report compliance for field teams. Staff file a report each working day, leads approve them, and managers watch two things: whether reports are filed and approved on time, and whether the hours claimed on a report match the hours a timer actually tracked.","A clean-room portfolio build. It models the kind of workforce-compliance platform I built and run at work, which is private. No code, data or policy from that system is used here; every name and number is invented.","It runs permanently in demo mode on seeded data for a fictional company, Example Co Field Services. Nothing is ever sent, the integrations are simulated, and the data resets nightly."],"features":["The queue of reports awaiting approval, scoped to the approver's teams, with an SLA badge (invented rule: approve within 48 hours of filing; \"due soon\" is the last 12 hours), filters, search, select-all and a detail…","Approving writes to an external project-management API. Here that API is the PmApi interface with one implementation, SimulatedPmApi (150-400 ms latency, fails on demand, rejects duplicate idempotency keys).","Bulk approve creates an approvalbatch row and one approvalbatchitem row per report. A worker claims items with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, calls the API, and records each outcome. The panel polls once a second and shows…","Tick \"Demo: simulate an API outage after N items\" before approving. The batch halts, stays in the database as interrupted, and \"Resume\" / \"Retry failed\" finish it. Reports that were already approved are never sent…","/approvals/scorecard: per approver over 30 days, computed in one SQL function: approved count, median time to approve, share within SLA, current backlog. Sortable, with inline bars."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jamil1016/fieldnote/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d26ceb5856b7a943ce9142aa62c738fca06b75c7de88f4410f2db16652efc4fb","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.614Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.614Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Daily-report compliance for field teams. Staff file a report each working day, leads approve them, and managers watch two things: whether reports are filed and approved on time, and whether the hours claimed on a report match the hours a timer actually tracked.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jamil1016/fieldnote/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Live demo: (click Enter demo; no account needed).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jamil1016/fieldnote/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Visitors share one login, so there are no free-text fields that persist, no uploads and no credential settings.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jamil1016/fieldnote/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d26ceb5856b7a943ce9142aa62c738fca06b75c7de88f4410f2db16652efc4fb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jamil1016/fieldnote/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.615Z"